[2026-01-30T08:26:47.508Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\nAnalysis:\nLet me analyze the conversation chronologically to capture all the important details.\n\n1. The user is executing multiple requirement files sequentially, each implementing a specific UI/performance improvement.\n\n2. Requirements executed:\n   - idea-30e46e8c-memoize-keypoints-heatmapdata: Memoize keyPoints/heatmapData/timelineEvents with stable keys\n   - idea-37b3d00c-virtualize-findingsview-table: Virtualize FindingsView table rows for large datasets\n   - idea-5249aa47-standardize-tab-indicator-anim: Standardize tab indicator animation across themes\n   - idea-581400d0-lazy-load-visualization-compon: Lazy load visualization components\n   - idea-656762d1-add-sticky-section-headers-in: Add sticky section headers in long scrolling views\n   - idea-661f33a6-add-focus-trap-and-improved-mo: Add focus trap and improved modal accessibility\n   - idea-706f7ff9-add-breathing-animation-to-foc: Add breathing animation to FocusMode ambient glow\n   - idea-76bf670c-add-visual-chain-connector-to: Add visual chain connector to CausalChainCard\n   - idea-8c96b274-add-aria-labels-and-roles-to-p: Add ARIA labels and roles to ProgressBar and rings\n   - idea-a354f0c1-unify-inteldashboard-grid-with: Unify IntelDashboard grid with consistent 8px spacing rhythm\n   - idea-a9a3097b-standardize-section-header-typ: Standardize section header typography across all views\n   - idea-af741c95-add-page-transition-animation: Add page transition animation between views (IN PROGRESS)\n\n3. Key files modified:\n   - OverviewView.tsx - memoization, lazy loading, ViewHeader\n   - FindingsView.tsx - virtualization with @tanstack/react-virtual, ViewHeader\n   - ThemedSidebar.tsx - TabIndicator component for sliding animation\n   - EntitiesView.tsx - sticky headers, ViewHeader\n   - AnalysisView.tsx - sticky headers, ViewHeader\n   - ReportShell.tsx - focus trap, ARIA attributes\n   - ReportView.tsx - titleId for accessibility\n   - FocusMode.tsx - breathing animation with reduced motion support\n   - AnalysisTab.tsx - CausalChainCard visual chain connectors\n   - ProgressBar.tsx - ARIA attributes\n   - AnimatedNumber.tsx - ARIA attributes for AnimatedProgressRing\n   - IntelDashboard.tsx - 8px spacing rhythm\n   - ViewHeader.tsx - NEW component for consistent typography\n   - useFocusTrap.ts - NEW hook for focus management\n\n4. The most recent work was starting on idea-af741c95-add-page-transition-animation. I read the requirement file and the ReportView.tsx file. The task is to add AnimatePresence with directional transitions for view switching.\n\n5. There were some errors encountered:\n   - PulsingDot import was accidentally removed from ThemedSidebar.tsx but still used in Stats section\n   - Several \"File has not been read yet\" errors when trying to edit files\n\n6. User messages were all simple execution commands: \"Execute the requirement file: [filename]\"\n\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   The user is sequentially executing requirement files that implement UI/UX and performance improvements for a research report viewing application. Each requirement file contains specific implementation instructions that must be executed immediately without questions. The pattern is: \"Execute the requirement file: idea-[hash]-[description]\"\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - React.lazy() and Suspense for code splitting\n   - @tanstack/react-virtual for virtualized lists\n   - Framer Motion for animations (AnimatePresence, motion.div, layoutId)\n   - useMemo for memoization with stable keys\n   - ARIA attributes for accessibility (role=\"progressbar\", aria-valuenow, aria-live)\n   - Focus trap pattern for modal accessibility\n   - prefers-reduced-motion media query support\n   -