t element\n\n   - `src/components/report/features/FocusMode.tsx`\n     - Added breathing animation to ambient glow\n     - Added useReducedMotion hook for accessibility\n     ```typescript\n     animate={reducedMotion ? { scale: 1, opacity: 0.05 } : {\n       scale: [0.95, 1.05, 0.95],\n       opacity: [0.03, 0.07, 0.03],\n     }}\n     transition={reducedMotion ? undefined : { duration: 4, ease: 'easeInOut', repeat: Infinity }}\n     ```\n\n   - `src/components/report/tabs/AnalysisTab.tsx`\n     - Replaced arrow icons with continuous line and node connectors in CausalChainCard\n\n   - `src/components/report/shared/ProgressBar.tsx`\n     - Added aria-label prop, role=\"progressbar\", aria-valuenow/min/max\n\n   - `src/components/report/core/AnimatedNumber.tsx`\n     - Added ARIA attributes to AnimatedProgressRing including aria-live=\"polite\"\n\n   - `src/components/report/features/IntelDashboard.tsx`\n     - Changed gap-3 to gap-2, standardized p-4 padding, text-[11px] labels, text-2xl values\n\n   - `src/components/report/shared/ViewHeader.tsx`\n     - NEW file: Standardized header component\n     ```typescript\n     export function ViewHeader({ title, subtitle, actions, count }: ViewHeaderProps) {\n       return (\n         <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-4\">\n           <div>\n             <h2 className={`text-lg font-semibold ${styles.text}`}>\n               {title}\n               {count !== undefined && <span className={`ml-2 text-sm font-normal ${styles.textMuted}`}>({count})</span>}\n             </h2>\n             {subtitle && <p className={`text-sm mt-0.5 ${styles.textMuted}`}>{subtitle}</p>}\n           </div>\n           {actions && <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2\">{actions}</div>}\n         </div>\n       );\n     }\n     ```\n\n   - `src/components/report/ReportView.tsx`\n     - Current file being modified for page transitions\n     - Contains view switching logic at lines 86-96\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - **PulsingDot import removed accidentally**: When updating ThemedSidebar.tsx, I removed useThemeStyles import but PulsingDot was still used in the Stats section. Fixed by adding PulsingDot back to the import.\n   - **\"File has not been read yet\" errors**: Several times tried to edit files without reading them first. Fixed by reading the file before editing.\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - Virtualization challenge: FindingRow had expandable content, solved with dynamic estimateSize callback\n   - Focus trap complexity: Created comprehensive useFocusTrap hook with returnFocusTo, autoFocus options\n   - Reduced motion support: Added useReducedMotion hook to respect user preferences\n\n6. All user messages:\n   - \"Execute the requirement file: idea-30e46e8c-memoize-keypoints-heatmapdata\"\n   - \"Execute the requirement file: idea-37b3d00c-virtualize-findingsview-table\"\n   - \"Execute the requirement file: idea-5249aa47-standardize-tab-indicator-anim\"\n   - \"Execute the requirement file: idea-581400d0-lazy-load-visualization-compon\"\n   - \"Execute the requirement file: idea-656762d1-add-sticky-section-headers-in\"\n   - \"Execute the requirement file: idea-661f33a6-add-focus-trap-and-improved-mo\"\n   - \"Execute the requirement file: idea-706f7ff9-add-breathing-animation-to-foc\"\n   - \"Execute the requirement file: idea-76bf670c-add-visual-chain-connector-to\"\n   - \"Execute the requirement file: idea-8c96b274-add-aria-labels-and-roles-to-p\"\n   - \"Execute the requirement file: idea-a354f0c1-unify-inteldashboard-grid-with\"\n   - \"Execute the requirement file: idea-a9a3097b-standardize-section-header-typ\"\n   - \"Execute the requirement file: idea-af741c95-add-page-transition-animation\"\n\n7. Pending Tasks:\n   - Complete idea-af741c95-add-page-transition-animation implementation\n   - Run TypeScript check after implementation\n   - (Optional) Log implementation using MCP tools as mentioned in requirement files\n\n8. Current Work:\n   Working on **idea-af741c95-add-page-transition-animation** - Adding page transition animations between views.\n   \n   The requirement specifies:\n   - Wrap view content in AnimatePresence with mode=\"wait\"\n   - Add motion.div with initial={{opacity:0,x:20}} animate={{opacity:1,x:0}} exit={{opacity:0,x:-20}}\n   - transition={{duration:0.15}}\n   - Direction should follow navigation (forward=right, back=left)\n   \n   I read the ReportView.tsx file and identified lines 86-96 where view switching happens:\n   ```typescript\n   {/* Content */}\n   <div className=\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-6\">\n     <div className=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto\">\n       {activeTab === 'overview' && <OverviewView session={session} stats={stats} />}\n       {activeTab === 'findings' && <FindingsView ... />}\n       {activeTab === 'sources' && <SourcesView ... />}\n       {activeTab === 'perspectives' && <PerspectivesView ... />}\n       {activeTab === 'analysis' && <AnalysisView ... />}\n       {activeTab === 'entities' && <EntitiesView ... />}\n     </div>\n   </div>\n   ```\n\n9. Optional Next Step:\n   Add AnimatePresence wrapper and motion.div transitions to ReportView.tsx. Need to:\n   1. Import AnimatePresence from framer-motion\n   2. Track previous tab to determine navigation direction\n   3. Wrap views in AnimatePresence mode=\"wait\"\n   4. Add motion.div with directional animations based on tab order\n\n   Quote from requirement: \"Wrap view content in AnimatePresence with mode='wait' and add motion.div with initial={{opacity:0,x:20}} animate={{opacity:1,x:0}} exit={{opacity:0,x:-20}} transition={{duration:0.15}}. Direction should follow navigation (forward=right, back=left).\"\n\nIf you need specific details from before compaction (like exact code snippets, error messages, or content you generated), read the full transcript at: C:\\Users\\mkdol\\.claude\\projects\\C--Users-mkdol-dolla-res\\a8a4f9ca-6a40-4b19-853c-2be96846861c.jsonl\nPlease continue the conversation from where we left it off without asking the